oto_2026-01-27_13-50-30.jpg\" alt=\"2024 Tech\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"Year2023\" class=\"ct-year-content\">\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"ct-year-details\">\r\n            <h3>Cultural exchange program: Universitas Merdeka Malang, Indonesia<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ct-year-gallery\">\r\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/IMG_0585-scaled.jpg\">\r\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/IMG_0711-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"2023 Study\">\r\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/DSC04607-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"2023 Books\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ct-year-details\">\r\n            <h3>Cultural exchange program: Jiangsu College of Engineering and Technology, China<\/h3>\r\n            <div class=\"ct-year-gallery\">\r\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/IMG_20230927_123507_155-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"2023 Online\">\r\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/IMG_20230927_123743_701-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"2023 Study\">\r\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/IMG_20230927_124124_993-scaled.jpg\">\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n    function openYear(evt, yearName) {\r\n        var i, tabcontent, tablinks;\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ 1. Hide all content\r\n        tabcontent = document.getElementsByClassName(\"ct-year-content\");\r\n        for (i = 0; i < tabcontent.length; i++) {\r\n            tabcontent[i].style.display = \"none\";\r\n            tabcontent[i].classList.remove(\"active-content\");\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ 2. Remove \"active\" class from all buttons\r\n        tablinks = document.getElementsByClassName(\"ct-tab-btn\");\r\n        for (i = 0; i < tablinks.length; i++) {\r\n            tablinks[i].className = tablinks[i].className.replace(\" active\", \"\");\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        \/\/ 3. Show the specific year and add \"active\" class to the button clicked\r\n        document.getElementById(yearName).style.display = \"block\";\r\n        document.getElementById(yearName).classList.add(\"active-content\");\r\n        evt.currentTarget.className += \" active\";\r\n    }\r\n<\/script>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-71ab395 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"71ab395\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Welcome International Student! Dear international scholars and students! &#8220;It is with great pleasure that I extend a warm welcome to each of you as you embark on your educational journey with Cambodia University of Technology and Science (CamTech) \u2013 a university founded with internationalization at the heart of its mission. As the Founding President, I am thrilled to see the CamTech community expanding both regionally and internationally, and I trust that the university will provide you with rich opportunities for learning, growth, and development that you are seeking. In just five years, CamTech has grown from a few dozen students to a vibrant community of over 500, offering key programs in science, technology, and innovation. The university combines academic rigor with real-world impact, preparing you not only for a career but for a meaningful life. The world is moving fast. Artificial intelligence, smart systems, robotics, energy innovation, and advanced technologies are shaping our collective future. At CamTech, we embrace these developments with curiosity, ethical responsibilities, and an interdisciplinary mindset. By joining CamTech, you are becoming part of not just a university but a dynamic and supportive community committed to innovation and positive change. I hope that your time at CamTech will provide moments for reflection and exploration, as well as academic rigor. In recent months, I have explored topics extending beyond technology alone\u2014AI for peace, ethical frameworks for AI governance, Buddhist perspectives on technology, and digital literacy for youth and adults in developing countries. These reflections inform CamTech\u2019s interdisciplinary approach to education, research, and innovation. If I were to summarize CamTech in three words, they would be Job, Life, and Planet. Our mission is simple yet ambitious: to cultivate graduates who can work with purpose, live with integrity, and contribute meaningfully to society and the planet. I encourage you to explore what CamTech has to offer. Visit our campus, speak with our students, and listen to their experiences. Engage with our faculty and staff, whose dedication is centered on helping students flourish intellectually, ethically, and personally \u2013 in body, mind, heart, and spirit. If you are ready for transformation, our vibrant and supportive community is here to help you realize your full potential. CamTech is your platform to dream big, learn deeply, and make a difference. &#8221; Welcome to CamTech. Welcome to your future. Prof. Dr. Sothy KHIENG Founding president General Information Course catalogue Academic Calendar Accommodation Application &#038; Visa Process Health insurance &#038; medical Grading System International Student Guidebook 2026 2025 2024 2023 Cultural exchange program: Universitas Multimedia Nusantara, Indonesia Cultural exchange program: Universitas Multimedia Nusantara, Indonesia<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":7,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"clos